  "notes": "Plain two-storey sandstone-block cube: cream-tan ashlar walls (block coursing pattern not expressible in schema), light grey plaster band at the floor line, a grey-tinted block course directly under the flat roof slab, and a light grey fascia slab with generous overhang. Two framed blue-grey windows per floor on the street facade, two slimmer ones per floor on the right side; no door visible in either ref (spec says 1 door) so an assumed rear door was placed on the back facade. FRONTAGE HAS NO BRICK WALL: a white PICKET fence (~1.7 m, spec fence color #f2f0ea; sampled in shade #b9b9b5) runs the whole frontage with a picket gate ~0.4 along it -- wall omitted, factory needs a picket fence type. Grey paving-brick sidewalk fills the frame to the bottom edge (no road visible, road block omitted). A large low-poly street tree stands in the sidewalk in front of the fence; behind the fence: lawn, banana plants and two olive-like shrubs. At the right edge a tan brick garden wall (#c9a87e) returns along the neighbouring lot. Sampled colours from 12x9 grids 2026-07-03."
